        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `detect_image_text.py` that detects text appearing inside an image, I will use the Amazon Rekognition service, which is a concrete external provider for image analysis. The code will import the necessary modules from the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and will include provider-specific environment variables and client configurations to make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
